  displayName: "Rattenk\xF6nig"
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36c68274b898f6d45a1236c85ff910af, type: 3}
  description: "The Rattenk\xF6nig is a monstrous avatar of a ratkin god - large,
    regal, and unmistakably unnatural - with a long tail and four angelic wings,
    creating a false celestial image and allowing sudden bursts of movement. Though
    a similar in size to a ratogre, this creature is unnaturally fast, darting and
    leaping with terrifying agility for its size. It does not speak, sicne their
    magical nature allows them to communicate telepathically to the whole hive."
